---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Photo review" description="Contact sheet for the Google Photos album." current="review" noindex>
  <section class="review">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1>Photo review</h1>
      <p>122 photos from Ben's Google Photos album, optimised to WebP (1600px, quality 82).
        Total 50.7 MB, down from 126 MB. Click any thumbnail to view full-size.
        Tell me which numbers to use where (hero, pillars, board portraits, campaigns, Field Notes).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card" data-name="photo_001">
        <img src="/photos/photo_001-thumb.webp" alt="photo_001" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open('/photos/photo_001.webp','_blank')" />
